Feature: Pet Store API CRUD Operations\n\n  Scenario: Create a new pet\n    Given the API endpoint is \"https://petstore.swagger.io/v2/pet\"\n    When I send a POST request with the following pet details\n      | id   | name  | status |\n      | 1234 | Fluffy | available |\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the response should contain the pet name \"Fluffy\"\n\n  Scenario: Retrieve an existing pet\n    Given the API endpoint is \"https://petstore.swagger.io/v2/pet/1234\"\n    When I send a GET request\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the response should contain the pet name \"Fluffy\"\n\n  Scenario: Update an existing pet\n    Given the API endpoint is \"https://petstore.swagger.io/v2/pet\"\n    When I send a PUT request with the following pet details\n      | id   | name  | status |\n      | 1234 | Fluffy | sold |\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the response should contain the pet status \"sold\"\n\n  Scenario: Delete an existing pet\n    Given the API endpoint is \"https://petstore.swagger.io/v2/pet/1234\"\n    When I send a DELETE request\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the pet should be successfully deleted